+/* A title can read its zeta as an ordinary colour texture: on RSX the buffer is
+ * just memory, so A8R8G8B8 at that offset sees the D24S8 bytes with stencil in
+ * B. GT5 draws all its text that way, inverting a stencil bit for each glyph
